                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="Ex-Showroom Price (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>exShowroomPrice}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- =====================================================
                            RTO - MTS / EV
                            ===================================================== -->

                        <!-- RTO % -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="100px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="RTO %"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>rtoPercent}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- RTO Amount -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="130px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="RTO Amount (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>rtoAmount}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- RTO With Bill -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="RTO With Bill (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>rtoWithBill}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- =====================================================
                            INSURANCE - MTS / EV
                            ===================================================== -->

                        <!-- Insurance Rate -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="130px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="Insurance Rate"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>insuranceRate}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Insurance Amount -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="150px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="Insurance Amount (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>insuranceAmount}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- TPA / PA -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="120px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="TPA / PA (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>tpaPa}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Insurance GST -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="Insurance GST (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>insuranceGst}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Total Insurance -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="150px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="Total Insurance (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>totalInsurance}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- On Road -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="150px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTS' || ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'EV' }">

                            <Label text="On-Road Price (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>onRoadPrice}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- =====================================================
                            MTO
                            ===================================================== -->

                        <!-- Reference MTS Model -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="180px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="Reference MTS Model"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Text text="{pricingModel>referenceMTSModel}"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- MTS Ex-Showroom -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="150px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="MTS Ex-Showroom (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>mtsExShowroom}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- MTS On-Road -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="MTS On-Road (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>mtsOnRoad}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- MIY Ex-Showroom -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="160px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="MIY Ex-Showroom Total (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>miyExShowroomTotal}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- MIY On-Road -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="MIY On-Road Total (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>miyOnRoadTotal}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Expected Ex-Showroom -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="170px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="Expected Ex-Showroom (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>expectedExShowroom}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Expected On-Road -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="160px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="Expected On-Road (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>expectedOnRoad}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Increment Dealer -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'MTO' }">

                            <Label text="Increment Dealer (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>incrementDealer}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- =====================================================
                            GeM
                            ===================================================== -->

                        <!-- Lowest MTS Ex-Showroom -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="180px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'GEM' }">

                            <Label text="Lowest MTS Ex-Showroom (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>lowestMtsExShowroom}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- GeM Discount % -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="130px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'GEM' }">

                            <Label text="GeM Discount %"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>gemDiscountPercent}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- GeM Discount -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'GEM' }">

                            <Label text="GeM Discount (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>gemDiscountAmount}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- GeM SubTotal -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'GEM' }">

                            <Label text="GeM SubTotal (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>gemSubTotal}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- GeM Basic -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="130px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'GEM' }">

                            <Label text="GeM Basic (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>gemBasic}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- GeM GST -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="130px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'GEM' }">

                            <Label text="GeM GST (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>gemGstAmount}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Final GeM Price -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="160px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'GEM' }">

                            <Label text="Final GeM Price (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>finalGemPrice}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- =====================================================
                            CSD
                            ===================================================== -->

                        <!-- CSD NSP -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="130px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD NSP (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdNsp}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD Basic Excl Helmet -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="180px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD Basic Excl Helmet (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdBasicExclHelmet}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD Discount % -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD Discount %"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdDiscountPercent}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD Discount -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD Discount (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdDiscountAmount}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD Pre-Tax -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="150px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD Pre-Tax Net (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdPreTaxNet}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD GST % -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="120px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD GST %"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdGstPercent}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD GST -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="140px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD GST (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdGstAmount}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD Ex-Showroom -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="170px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD Ex-Showroom (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdExShowroom}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Incidental % -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="120px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="Incidental %"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>incidentalPercent}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Incidental Charges -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="160px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="Incidental Charges (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>incidentalCharges}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD RTO -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="130px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="RTO Amount (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>rtoAmount}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD RTO With Bill -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="150px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="RTO With Bill (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>rtoWithBill}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD Total Insurance -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="160px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="Total Insurance (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>totalInsurance}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- Final CSD Price -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="160px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="Final CSD Price (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>finalCsdPrice}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- CSD On-Road -->
                        <table:Column
                            width="150px"
                            visible="{= ${viewModel>/orderType} === 'CSD' }">

                            <Label text="CSD On-Road (₹)"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <Input
                                    value="{pricingModel>csdOnRoad}"
                                    editable="false"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                        <!-- =====================================================
                            STATUS
                            ===================================================== -->

                        <table:Column width="120px">
                            <Label text="Status"/>

                            <table:template>
                                <ObjectStatus
                                    state="{= ${pricingModel>status} === 'APPROVED' ? 'Success' : ${pricingModel>status} === 'REJECTED' ? 'Error' : ${pricingModel>status} === 'SUBMITTED' ? 'Warning' : ${pricingModel>status} === 'DRAFT' ? 'Information' : 'None'}"
                                    icon="{= ${pricingModel>status} === 'APPROVED' ? 'sap-icon://status-positive' : ${pricingModel>status} === 'REJECTED' ? 'sap-icon://status-negative' : ${pricingModel>status} === 'SUBMITTED' ? 'sap-icon://alert' : ${pricingModel>status} === 'DRAFT' ? 'sap-icon://status-inactive' : ''}"
                                    text="{pricingModel>status}"/>
                            </table:template>

                        </table:Column>


                    </table:Table>


                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <HBox
                        justifyContent="SpaceBetween"
                        alignItems="Center"
                        class="sapUiSmallMarginTop">

                        <Text
                            text="Showing {pricingModel>/resultsCount} result(s)"/>

                        <!-- <HBox>

                            <Button
                                icon="sap-icon://navigation-left-arrow"
                                type="Transparent"
                                press=".onPreviousPage"/>

                            <Button
                                text="1"
                                type="Emphasized"
                                class="sapUiTinyMarginBegin sapUiTinyMarginEnd"/>

                            <Button
                                icon="sap-icon://navigation-right-arrow"
                                type="Transparent"
                                press=".onNextPage"/>

                        </HBox> -->

                    </HBox>

                </Panel>

            </VBox>
        </f:content>

    </f:DynamicPage>

</mvc:View>